    "No direct absolute oral bioavailability measurement is available for the query molecule.",
    "Lopinavir low-bioavailability reports are qualitative and not threshold-specific for F < 20%.",
    "No query-specific human pharmacokinetic data are provided.",
    "Potential food effects and formulation effects are not directly assessed for the query."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

